    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d587">

                <pb facs="0633" n="619" xml:id="pg619"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.61333/917: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Simmons</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-01-18T20:00:00-03:00">January 18, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 9:24 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>203. Department’s 158, January 12 [<hi rendition="#italic">15</hi>], 6
                        p.m.<anchor n="80" xml:id="d587-f1"/> The Embassy and FEA<anchor n="81"
                        xml:id="d587-f2"/> agree that it would be inexpedient to raise question of
                    shipping of coffee at this time.</p>
                <p>Souza Costa and Guedes of DNC are studying proposal for termination of agreement;
                    Guedes is strongly opposed to it. It appears that Souza Costa is awaiting the
                    return of Penteado<anchor n="82" xml:id="d587-f3"/> before making a definite
                    decision. The Embassy told the Foreign Office today that we expect to terminate
                    the coffee agreement simultaneously with the ship deal.<anchor n="83"
                        xml:id="d587-f4"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simmons</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d587-f1" n="80" xml:id="d587-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f2" n="81" xml:id="d587-f2-content">
                <p>Foreign Economic Administration.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f3" n="82" xml:id="d587-f3-content">
                <p>Eurico Penteado, Brazilian delegate to the Inter-American Coffee Board.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f4" n="83" xml:id="d587-f4-content">
                <p>For correspondence on cooperation between the United States and Brazil with
                    respect to shipping problems, see <ref target="#pg642">pp. 642</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
